	"system": {
		"description": "<p>At 13th level, your construct may attempt to overcharge their weaponry. As an action, the construct must roll 3 hit dice and take an equal amount of damage, then choose a creature or object within 90ft as a target. The target and all creatures or objects within 5ft take 3d6 bludgeoning and 3d6 fire damage from the resulting explosion, or half damage on a successful Dexterity save.</p>",
